From 1affa12771fb0cfb0fe2ae0043e82d769723f89c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergey Fedorov <barracuda@macos-powerpc.org>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 00:59:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/36] Composer, Cryptography, MSA, Streams, UiUtils: convert
 new-style connects to SIGNAL/SLOT syntax

Converts every connect()/disconnect() in these directories to the
Qt4-compatible string-based form, including the lambda connect in
Cryptography/MessagePart.cpp (kept dual-buildable even though the
Cryptography sources only build under WITH_QT5).
---
